From 7c8dcccc4724f4edcd18f2a10946a9d84951eafd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jorink <maxjorink@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:24:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] fair: port mangowm's fair layout and grid resize

Port of fair_core (src/layout/horizontal.c) and resize_tile_grid_fair
(src/layout/arrange.c) from mangowm, without gaps.

- cols = ceil(sqrt(n)), filled column by column; the last n % cols
  columns get one extra row
- per-column and per-row weights, kept by the clients
- resizedir(): keyboard resize (tiled: move the grid boundary,
  floating: change the size)
- MOD + right drag on a tiled client changes the weights instead of
  floating it
